'''Ja'darri''' (also known in the Dragon tongue as Toshrakhat), was an ancient [[ON:Khajiit|Khajiit]] hero and the founder of both [[ON:Pridehome|Pridehome]] and the [[Online:Pride of Alkosh|Pride of Alkosh]]. During the times of the Dragon Cult in Elsweyr, she became an ally of the [[ON:Dragonguard|Dragonguard]] as well as the bearer of the [[Lore:Mask of Alkosh|Mask of Alkosh]] through her unlikely alliance with [[ON:Nahfahlaar|Nahfahlaar]] to take down the [[ON:Laatvulon|Demon from the East]].

In the present day, you will encounter her spirit in the [[ON:Halls of the Highmane (place)|Halls of the Highmane]] and the realm known as the [[ON:Spilled Sand|Spilled Sand]].
